from cp21f.replay
# Event branch m6-event-shaymin (docs/decisions.md: the dev-only event flag;
# docs/research/postgame.md §6): Oak's Letter (`event shaymin`) from cp21f's end (its National Pokédex). Route 224's on-transition
# shows Oak and, as the letter's gift set VAR_SHAYMIN_EVENT_STATE 1 (decomp InitShayminEvent; 2026-10-19), moves it to 2
# and VAR_ROUTE_224_STATE to 1: Marley's coordinate event at the route's west edge brings her to the tablet, and she is
# in Shaymin's scene and its thanks. Talking to Oak walks the player to the tablet: the tablet's naming screen (open_shaymin_tablet_naming_screen)
# takes a word, "thank … ?" YES; the Seabreak Path opens (its hidden location), the field player's volume drops
# (set_player_volume), Shaymin's scene plays, the volume comes back: FLAG_WROTE_ON_ROUTE_224_TABLET, Oak and Marley gone,
# the word kept (GameState.tabletName; buffer_tablet_name reads it back at the tablet). m6-event-shaymin-caught chains on.
# Kept setup: the event flag and the warp (off the chain).
event shaymin
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_224 902 497 right
until idle
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_ROUTE_224_PROF_OAK false
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_SHAYMIN_EVENT_STATE 2
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_ROUTE_224_STATE 1
# Marley's coordinate event (VAR_ROUTE_224_STATE 1): she walks up and on to the tablet.
+0 press right
until position 903 497 300
+0 release right
advance text 3000
until idle 3000
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_ROUTE_224_MARLEY false
+0 press right
until position 909 497 300
+0 release right
+0 press up
until position 909 493 300
+0 release up
until idle 60
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
until app naming 3000
+1 tap type:Mom
+1 tap ok
until app none 600
advance text 3000
+0 assert state tabletName "Mom"
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 6000
until idle 6000
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_WROTE_ON_ROUTE_224_TABLET true
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_ROUTE_224_PROF_OAK true
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_ROUTE_224_MARLEY true
+0 assert state tabletName "Mom"
# The tablet now reads the word back (buffer_tablet_name).
+0 press up
+1 release up
until idle 60
+0 press a
+1 release a
until message 600
+0 assert text platinum:Route224_Text_NameWhomIThank 0 1=Mom
advance text 600
until idle 600
